# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "An [`InitializeModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-initialize-modes#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes\") gate declares a reference mode occupation; an [`OrbitalRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-orbital-rotation#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation\") gate rotates the single-particle basis. Placed back to back, the two gates prepare a *Slater determinant*; the modes start in the reference determinant and are then rotated into the target orbitals. The [`PrepareSlaterDeterminant`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-prepare-slater-determinant#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant\") gate captures that composition, and because it carries the reference occupation, transpiling it can use the rectangular [`givens_decomposition_slater()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/linalg-givens-decomposition-slater#qiskit_fermions.linalg.givens_decomposition_slater \"qiskit_fermions.linalg.givens_decomposition_slater\"), which realizes only the *occupied* orbitals, instead of the full square decomposition an [`OrbitalRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-orbital-rotation#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation\") alone requires. That is a strictly cheaper synthesis (see the payoff at the end of this guide).\n"
msgstr "O poartă [`InitializeModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-initialize-modes#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes\") declară o ocupare de referință a modurilor; o poartă [`OrbitalRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-orbital-rotation#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation\") rotește baza cu o singură particulă. Puse una după alta, cele două porți pregătesc un *determinant Slater*; modurile pornesc în determinantul de referință și sunt apoi rotite în orbitalii țintă. Poarta [`PrepareSlaterDeterminant`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-prepare-slater-determinant#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant\") surprinde această compoziție și, pentru că poartă ocuparea de referință, transpilarea ei poate folosi [`givens_decomposition_slater()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/linalg-givens-decomposition-slater#qiskit_fermions.linalg.givens_decomposition_slater \"qiskit_fermions.linalg.givens_decomposition_slater\") dreptunghiulară, care realizează doar orbitalii *ocupați*, în loc de descompunerea pătrată completă pe care o necesită doar un [`OrbitalRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-orbital-rotation#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation\"). Aceasta este o sinteză strict mai ieftină (vezi beneficiul la finalul acestui ghid).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The [`MergeSlaterDeterminantPreparation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-merge-slater-determinant-preparation#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.MergeSlaterDeterminantPreparation \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.MergeSlaterDeterminantPreparation\") transpiler pass detects the [`InitializeModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-initialize-modes#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes\")-then-[`OrbitalRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-orbital-rotation#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation\") pattern in a [`FermionicCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-fermionic-circuit#qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit\") and rewrites it into [`PrepareSlaterDeterminant`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-prepare-slater-determinant#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant\") gates, so a later synthesis stage picks up the reduced decomposition automatically. Under simulation, the rewrite is a no-op on the state: [`PrepareSlaterDeterminant`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-prepare-slater-determinant#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant\") is *validate-then-rotate* (it validates the reference occupation and then applies the rotation, just as the two separate gates do), so the merge unlocks the cheaper synthesis without changing the prepared state.\n"
msgstr "Pasul de transpilare [`MergeSlaterDeterminantPreparation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-merge-slater-determinant-preparation#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.MergeSlaterDeterminantPreparation \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.MergeSlaterDeterminantPreparation\") detectează tiparul [`InitializeModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-initialize-modes#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes\") urmat de [`OrbitalRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-orbital-rotation#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation\") într-un [`FermionicCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-fermionic-circuit#qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit\") și îl rescrie în porți [`PrepareSlaterDeterminant`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-prepare-slater-determinant#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant\"), astfel încât o etapă de sinteză ulterioară preia automat descompunerea redusă. În simulare, rescrierea nu modifică starea: [`PrepareSlaterDeterminant`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-prepare-slater-determinant#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant\") este *validate-then-rotate* (validează ocuparea de referință și apoi aplică rotația, exact cum fac cele două porți separate), așa că fuzionarea deblochează sinteza mai ieftină fără a schimba starea pregătită.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Throughout this guide, each circuit is drawn before and after the pass, side by side: the input on the left, and the result of running the pass on it on the right. Two helpers do that. `merge` runs the pass on a copy of the circuit (through its [`FermionicDAGCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-fermionic-dag-circuit#qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicDAGCircuit \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicDAGCircuit\")) and converts the result back to a drawable [`FermionicCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-fermionic-circuit#qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit\"), and `draw_merge` draws both halves into a single before/after figure:\n"
msgstr "În tot acest ghid, fiecare circuit este desenat înainte și după pas, unul lângă altul: intrarea în stânga, iar în dreapta rezultatul rulării pasului asupra ei. Două funcții ajutătoare fac asta. `merge` rulează pasul pe o copie a circuitului (prin [`FermionicDAGCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-fermionic-dag-circuit#qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicDAGCircuit \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicDAGCircuit\")) și convertește rezultatul înapoi într-un [`FermionicCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-fermionic-circuit#qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit\") ce poate fi desenat, iar `draw_merge` desenează ambele jumătăți într-o singură figură înainte/după:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "What gets merged {#what-gets-merged}"
msgstr "Ce se fuzionează {#what-gets-merged}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The pass recognizes three patterns, all keyed off the block-spin mode convention that [`InitializeModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-initialize-modes#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes\") and [`OrbitalRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-orbital-rotation#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation\") use. For a system with `norb` spatial orbitals, the modes `0..norb` are the spin-alpha sector, and `norb..2*norb` are the spin-beta sector. Slater determinant preparation is done per spin sector because each sector has its own (electrons, orbitals) shape.\n"
msgstr "Pasul recunoaște trei tipare, toate bazate pe convenția modurilor cu spini în blocuri pe care o folosesc [`InitializeModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-initialize-modes#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes\") și [`OrbitalRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-orbital-rotation#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation\"). Pentru un sistem cu `norb` orbitali spațiali, modurile `0..norb` formează sectorul de spin alfa, iar `norb..2*norb` sectorul de spin beta. Pregătirea determinantului Slater se face pe fiecare sector de spin, deoarece fiecare sector are propria formă (electroni, orbitali).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Full-register (or spinless) {#full-register-or-spinless}"
msgstr "Registru complet (sau fără spin) {#full-register-or-spinless}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The simplest pattern is using [`InitializeModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-initialize-modes#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes\"), immediately followed by an [`OrbitalRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-orbital-rotation#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation\") on the *same* modes. This is the spinless case (one determinant over all modes) and also a spinful circuit whose rotation spans both sectors at once. The two gates fuse into a single [`PrepareSlaterDeterminant`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-prepare-slater-determinant#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant\"):\n"
msgstr "Cel mai simplu tipar este folosirea unui [`InitializeModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-initialize-modes#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes\"), urmat imediat de un [`OrbitalRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-orbital-rotation#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation\") pe *aceleași* moduri. Acesta este cazul fără spin (un singur determinant peste toate modurile) și, totodată, un circuit cu spin a cărui rotație acoperă ambele sectoare deodată. Cele două porți fuzionează într-un singur [`PrepareSlaterDeterminant`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-prepare-slater-determinant#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.PrepareSlaterDeterminant\"):\n"

